#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:19
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2`(BF16 version): requires 2 Atlas 800 A3 (128G × 8) node or 4 "
"Atlas 800 A2 (64G × 8) node.[Download model "
"weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/ZhipuAI/GLM-5.2)."
