"`GLM-5.2`(BF16版本)需要2个Atlas 800 A3 (128G × 8)节点或4个Atlas 800 A2 (64G × "
"8)节点：[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/ZhipuAI/GLM-5.2)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:20
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (128G × 8) node or 2 Atlas 800 A2"
" (64G × 8) node.[Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models"
"/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.2-w8a8)."
