#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:895
msgid "Deployment on 8 Atlas 800 A2"
msgstr "在8个Atlas 800 A2上部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:897
msgid ""
"On Atlas 800 A2, where each node exposes 8 cards, the same global P/D "
"topology (Prefill `DP4 TP8`, Decode `DP8 TP4`) is split across 8 nodes: 4"
" prefill nodes hosting 1 DP rank each (8 cards per rank), and 4 decode "
"nodes hosting 2 DP ranks each (4 cards per rank). The "
"`launch_online_dp.py` above is reused as-is. The prefill side enables "
"FlashComm1 and DSA CP; the decode side enables MLAPO and `DYNAMIC_EPLB` "
"with a `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph. Both sides enable prefix caching and MTP"
" (`num_speculative_tokens=3`). All IPs, NIC names, ports and weight paths"
" below are placeholders."
msgstr ""
"在Atlas 800 A2上，每个节点暴露8张卡，相同的全局P/D拓扑(Prefill `DP4 TP8`，Decode `DP8 "
"TP4`)分布在8个节点上：4个prefill节点各托管1个DP rank(每rank 8卡)，4个decode节点各托管2个DP "
"rank(每rank 4卡)。上述`launch_online_dp.py`保持不变直接复用。Prefill端启用FlashComm1和DSA "
"CP；Decode端启用MLAPO和带`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`图的`DYNAMIC_EPLB`。两端均启用前缀缓存和MTP(`num_speculative_tokens=3`)。以下所有IP、网卡名称、端口和权重路径均为占位符。"

